OL,3,GNEWSAFatboy Slim to headline Lytham
OL,4,AFestival in 2027
OL,5,
OL,6,FDJ Fatboy Slim has been announced as
OL,7,Fthe latest headline act for next year's
OL,8,FLytham Festival.
OL,10,FThe Praise You musician, whose real
OL,11,Fname is Norman Cook, will perform on
OL,12,FLytham Green on Friday 2 July,
OL,13,Fsupported by dance artist Becky Hill.
OL,15,FIt follows the recent announcement of
OL,16,FRobbie Williams as a headline act at
OL,17,Fthe annual five-day festival, which
OL,18,Fattracted more than 110,000 fans
OL,19,Fearlier this year.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
